---
title: CMN — Employee ↔ IdentityUser Synchronization
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant AC as EmployeeController
    participant AS as EmployeeAppService
    participant DB as SQL Server (ADM schema)
    participant IM as IdentityUserManager

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over AC,IM: Create Employee (CreateAsync)

        AC->>AS: CreateAsync(CreateEmployeeInputDto)

        Note over AS,DB: Step 1 — Uniqueness checks in Employee table
        AS->>DB: Any Employee WHERE Email = @email AND TenantId = @tenantId?
        DB-->>AS: false (or throw DuplicateEmail)
        AS->>DB: Any Employee WHERE OtherEmail = @otherEmail?
        DB-->>AS: false (or throw DuplicateOtherEmail)
        AS->>DB: Any Employee WHERE PhoneNumber = @phone?
        DB-->>AS: false (or throw DuplicatePhone)

        Note over AS,IM: Step 2 — Create IdentityUser first
        AS->>IM: CreateAsync(IdentityUser { UserName=email, Email, PhoneNumber })
        IM-->>AS: IdentityUser.Id

        Note over AS,DB: Step 3 — Create Employee linked to IdentityUser
        AS->>DB: INSERT Employee { ..., UserId=identityUser.Id, IsFirstLogin=true }
        DB-->>AS: Employee.Id

        AS-->>AC: EmployeeOutputDto
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over AC,IM: Update Employee (UpdateDetailAsync — partial update)

        AC->>AS: UpdateDetailAsync(id, UpdateEmployeeInputDto)
        AS->>DB: Find Employee by Id

        Note over AS,IM: Only loads IdentityUser if identity-linked fields changing
        alt Name, Email, PhoneNumber, or IsActive in update
            AS->>IM: FindByIdAsync(employee.UserId)
            IM-->>AS: IdentityUser

            AS->>AS: employee.Name = input.Name (if provided)
            AS->>AS: employee.Email = input.Email (if provided)
            AS->>AS: employee.PhoneNumber = input.PhoneNumber (if provided)

            AS->>IM: Sync: identityUser.Name = employee.Name
            AS->>IM: Sync: identityUser.Email = employee.Email
            AS->>IM: Sync: identityUser.UserName = employee.Email
            AS->>IM: Sync: identityUser.PhoneNumber = employee.PhoneNumber

            alt IsActive = false
                AS->>IM: SetLockoutEnabledAsync(user, true)
                AS->>IM: SetLockoutEndDateAsync(user, DateTimeOffset.MaxValue)
                Note over IM: User cannot log in (permanent lockout until re-activated)
            else IsActive = true (re-activation)
                AS->>IM: SetLockoutEndDateAsync(user, null)
            end

            AS->>IM: UpdateAsync(identityUser)
        end

        AS->>DB: UPDATE Employee (partial — only changed fields)
        AS-->>AC: EmployeeOutputDto
    end
